<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH MARCH REAL IND SALES FALL 0.8 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH MARCH REAL IND SALES FALL 0.8 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech March preliminary real industrial sales fell 0.8 percent, year-on-year, after a 3.6 percent year-on-year decline in February, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Tuesday.</p>
